# macOS screenshots land in the repo root when they are taken here. The name
# carries a narrow no-break space before AM/PM, hence the wildcard.
Screenshot *.png
.DS_Store

# Per-machine tool permissions, not site content. The file says local in its
# own name; it has no business in a repo that is also the deployed site.
.claude/

# The resume export that still carries a home address and phone number in its
# text layer. Kept out of the repo by name so that a routine `git add -A`
# cannot publish it; the redacted export tracks normally as
# dante-smith-resume.pdf.
*-unredacted.pdf

# Knowledge-graph output from the graphify skill, including its query log.
# Tool scratch, and this repo is served as-is — anything committed here is
# published at dantesmith.studio.
graphify-out/

# Brainstorm and planning scratch from the superpowers skills. Tool output,
# and like everything else here it would be published if committed.
.superpowers/

# Contact sheets for the inspo tagging pass: scratch, rebuilt on demand.
inspo/.work/

# Are.na token for the inspo sync. Never commit it: this repo is the published site.
inspo/.env

# Inspo search working data: rebuilt by inspo/sync.mjs and inspo/merge.py.
# Only inspo/index.json (which also carries every tag) is published.
inspo/blocks.json
inspo/tags.json
